desc: Replace the text inside the quotes
category: motion
par: 13
hint1: A text object can target what's between the quotes
hint2: ci" works from anywhere on the line — no need to move to the quote first
solution: ci"New Title<Esc>
note: ci" changes the text inside the double quotes; type the replacement, then <Esc>.
--- START ---
title = "old name"
--- GOAL ---
title = "New Title"
--- END ---
